WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:01.376
Spoiler alert.

00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:05.464
Not to mention
the trashy tattoo.

00:00:07.508 --> 00:00:08.926
Is this your skin?

00:00:16.058 --> 00:00:17.226
Oh, my God.

00:00:17.893 --> 00:00:18.727
Dad killed me.

00:00:19.311 --> 00:00:21.480
Oh, my God.
He killed me too, a lot.

00:00:22.773 --> 00:00:23.815
See?

00:00:42.835 --> 00:00:44.294
Concentrate, Klaus.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.055
I think you're getting
the hang of it, boy.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:00.936
Hotel Obsidian,

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:03.397
I missed you,
you slutty old dame.

00:01:04.273 --> 00:01:05.274
Absorb her.

00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:07.317
Absorb her into your bosom.

00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:09.027
You know,
'cause back in her heyday,

00:01:09.111 --> 00:01:11.280
she played host
to world leaders:

00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:13.949
Roosevelt, Gandhi,
Stalin, Gorbachev,

00:01:14.032 --> 00:01:16.076
Castro, King Olav of Norway,

00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:18.954
one of the Kim Jongs,
Tito, Dalai Lama, Elvis,

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:23.041
and not one, but two
Kardashians, allegedly.

00:01:29.131 --> 00:01:31.258
This is someone's
idea of heaven?

00:01:33.594 --> 00:01:34.678
What the…

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:36.263
-Hey, buddy.
-You.

00:01:36.346 --> 00:01:37.806
-No.
-Get back here.

00:01:37.890 --> 00:01:39.016
Get… Get back here!

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:40.058
That tickles.

00:01:40.767 --> 00:01:42.186
Let me go!

00:01:42.269 --> 00:01:45.814
How have you died 56 times
and come back to life?

00:01:45.898 --> 00:01:46.940
That's a trick question,

00:01:47.024 --> 00:01:48.942
'cause I didn't know
that I was doing that.

00:01:49.026 --> 00:01:50.652
Well, what did you think
you were doing?

00:01:50.736 --> 00:01:53.113
I just thought
I was one of those lovable,

00:01:53.197 --> 00:01:55.824
rascally
&lt;i&gt;Looney Tunes&lt;/i&gt; characters.

00:01:55.908 --> 00:01:57.409
Hit me on the head
with a hammer

00:01:57.492 --> 00:01:59.912
and I see some
cartoon birds.

00:01:59.995 --> 00:02:02.706
And then, bop,
I get back up.

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:05.209
This is nothing compared
to what I endured

00:02:05.292 --> 00:02:06.585
when I was your age.

00:02:06.668 --> 00:02:09.421
You know, he once gave me
six months laundry duty.

00:02:09.505 --> 00:02:11.423
Six months, just for pawning

00:02:11.507 --> 00:02:14.468
one of his stupid, priceless
artefacts from Mexico.

00:02:14.551 --> 00:02:17.095
Well, it turns out,
it did have a price, Dad,

00:02:17.179 --> 00:02:20.933
and that price
was $35 for meth.

00:02:21.016 --> 00:02:22.100
Thank you very much.

00:02:22.184 --> 00:02:23.685
Laundry duty doesn't
really seem that bad.

00:02:23.769 --> 00:02:24.937
Well, it is when you know

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:26.772
what your brothers do
into their socks.

00:02:27.773 --> 00:02:28.941
He's an alien.

00:02:29.024 --> 00:02:32.152
We're trying not to use that
kind of terminology here.

00:02:32.236 --> 00:02:34.363
And I know, it's whoa PC,

00:02:34.446 --> 00:02:36.698
but you could just say he's…

00:02:37.616 --> 00:02:38.450
British.

00:02:38.534 --> 00:02:41.245
Ever since you weaned me
off those damned pills…

00:02:42.579 --> 00:02:44.373
I'd like to return
the favour,

00:02:44.456 --> 00:02:46.792
help you to understand
who you really are.

00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:48.043
Would you like that?

00:02:48.126 --> 00:02:51.296
There's nothing
I'd like more,

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:53.090
other than
a probiotic yoghurt

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:54.633
that doesn't make me fart.

00:02:54.716 --> 00:02:56.218
Then get over here, boy.

00:02:57.469 --> 00:02:58.470
Okay.

00:03:05.769 --> 00:03:08.522
We are going to Pennsylvania

00:03:08.605 --> 00:03:09.565
to find…

00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:12.359
my birth mother.

00:03:12.442 --> 00:03:13.735
-Yay!
-Excuse me?

00:03:13.819 --> 00:03:14.987
I'm sorry. Okay? I'm sorry.

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:16.572
I just needed somebody
to come with me

00:03:16.655 --> 00:03:17.906
for emotional support.

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:19.199
-Oh, emotional support?
-Yeah.

00:03:19.283 --> 00:03:20.200
Like a Schnauzer.

00:03:20.284 --> 00:03:21.577
Yeah, and I knew
you wouldn't come

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:23.036
if I told you,
so what was I--

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:24.872
You're goddamn right
I wouldn't have come, Klaus.

00:03:24.955 --> 00:03:26.123
You know why?

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:28.834
Because I am
supposed to be retired.

00:03:28.917 --> 00:03:29.918
Yeah, I know. I know.

00:03:30.002 --> 00:03:31.461
This was to be
a carefree road trip.

00:03:31.545 --> 00:03:33.213
Well, it still can be, babe.

00:03:34.047 --> 00:03:35.716
Ball of twine. Klaus, turn!

00:03:35.799 --> 00:03:37.050
-Ball of twine! Turn!
-What?

00:03:37.134 --> 00:03:38.594
-Five!
-Turn!

00:03:38.677 --> 00:03:40.429
It's one of the best ones!
Come on!

00:03:40.512 --> 00:03:43.599
-Five, we're gonna die!
-I don't care! Let's go!

00:03:43.682 --> 00:03:46.018
Know what?
No twine, no birth mother!

00:03:46.101 --> 00:03:47.394
You're so Amish.

00:03:47.477 --> 00:03:49.104
-You're so--
-I'm kidding.

00:03:50.105 --> 00:03:51.523
We have all
the channels here.

00:03:52.774 --> 00:03:54.276
But mostly, I watch you.

00:03:56.028 --> 00:03:57.237
Even the naughty bits?

00:03:57.905 --> 00:03:59.364
You tricked me.

00:03:59.448 --> 00:04:01.450
See? Too slow!

00:04:01.533 --> 00:04:05.370
-Again!
-You're a terrible father!

00:04:05.454 --> 00:04:06.288
Again.

00:04:07.664 --> 00:04:09.666
-Come on.
-No. Put it back.

00:04:10.834 --> 00:04:12.085
Okay, you caught me.

00:04:14.046 --> 00:04:16.089
All of it, please. Yes. Yes.

00:04:16.173 --> 00:04:17.966
I thought you were supposed
to be the fun uncle.

00:04:19.092 --> 00:04:20.344
I know, me too.

00:04:23.138 --> 00:04:24.556
Can I just keep one thing?

00:04:25.599 --> 00:04:27.142
All right.
You can keep the panties.

00:04:29.811 --> 00:04:30.812
Ben-erino.

00:04:31.647 --> 00:04:34.858
You look so much better
alive than you do dead.

00:04:34.942 --> 00:04:35.984
Am I right?

00:04:36.068 --> 00:04:37.653
Except that haircut.

00:04:38.654 --> 00:04:40.239
What the hell
did you just say?

00:04:40.322 --> 00:04:42.407
Come on, come on,
stop with all the hostility,

00:04:42.491 --> 00:04:44.034
Mr. Grumpy Pants.

00:04:44.701 --> 00:04:46.745
Oh, wow. Nice scar.

00:04:46.828 --> 00:04:47.663
&lt;i&gt;Muy macho.&lt;/i&gt;

00:04:47.746 --> 00:04:49.248
Shut your mouth.

00:04:49.331 --> 00:04:51.291
You shut your mouth
and just hug your brother.

00:04:54.253 --> 00:04:55.087
What the hell?

00:04:58.924 --> 00:05:00.592
Think I figured this out.

00:05:05.806 --> 00:05:06.849
Six minutes.

00:05:07.516 --> 00:05:08.684
Four minutes.

00:05:08.767 --> 00:05:11.019
Two minutes. Excellent!

00:05:16.275 --> 00:05:18.110
-You two are hanging now?
-Yeah.

00:05:18.193 --> 00:05:20.821
We laughed, we cried.
We played in traffic.

00:05:20.904 --> 00:05:24.241
And, long story short,
I'm immortal now.

00:05:26.577 --> 00:05:28.120
Whoa, whoa, wait.
You're what now?

00:05:28.203 --> 00:05:30.038
-Oh, gimme that.
-What happened to you?

00:05:30.122 --> 00:05:33.667
Oh, just a spear gun
to the chest. No big deal.

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:35.127
I'm glad you came along.

00:05:37.379 --> 00:05:39.131
You're a good brother.

00:05:42.926 --> 00:05:44.469
All right, all right,
you say nice things

00:05:44.553 --> 00:05:45.512
about me now.

00:05:48.223 --> 00:05:49.933
Let's go find
your stupid mother.

00:05:52.227 --> 00:05:53.812
Love you too, tiny dancer.

00:05:53.896 --> 00:05:55.397
I'd love to stay here
idly chatting,

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:56.648
but I'm terribly busy.

00:05:56.732 --> 00:05:58.233
Yeah, well, too bad,

00:05:58.317 --> 00:05:59.902
'cause everything's
leading me back to you,

00:05:59.985 --> 00:06:02.446
back to here,
the White Buffalo Suite.

00:06:02.529 --> 00:06:04.865
The menudo
that resembled the painting.

00:06:04.948 --> 00:06:06.575
You know about
the White Buffalo Suite.

00:06:06.658 --> 00:06:07.993
That's where I died.

